perf-04 — FAZA 4: otpornost (svi periodični poslovi u worker, budžeti, CI kapija)

Primjena: bash perf/patches/apply-perf.sh   (ili git apply --3way)
Baza: perf-00 + perf-01 + perf-02 + perf-03 primijenjeni.

Sadržaj (po stavci plana §4.1–§4.2):
  4.1  arhiva / waiting-for-user / KB podsjetnici → BullMQ repeatable u workeru
       (queue + processor + scheduler po poslu; rasporedi :00/:05/:10)
  4.1  integration heartbeat + DLQ retencija → queue `integration-worker-maintenance`
  4.1  realtime most worker → Redis → API (sweep ne gubi live update)
  4.1  API graf bez job providera; worker dobio tri nova modula; dokazni specovi
  4.1  FE: status workera bez pollinga (ručno osvježavanje + prijevod bs/en)
  4.2  PERF_BUDGETS.md, .github/workflows/perf-smoke.yml, query-budget WARN s
       request_id + path, ops/runbook/{ws-reconnect-storm,redis-down,pg-pool-saturation}.md,
       ops/quarterly-perf-review.md

Nema migracija. Nema novih paketa.

Verifikacija: backend `npx jest --silent` 363 suita / 1366 testova; frontend
`npx vitest run` 95/333; `npx tsc --noEmit` čist (oba); `node perf/validate.js` 18/18.
Detalji, job karta, CI pragovi i zaključni izvještaj: perf/results/after-f4-2026-09-24.md.

